WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.975
ALEX: What does that tell you?

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:03.572
RUFUS: That they're building
institutional scaffolding they
never needed

00:00:03.572 --> 00:00:06.083
RUFUS: when Jensen was the
institution.

00:00:06.296 --> 00:00:08.707
JAMIE: Which is either reassuring
or slightly terrifying, depending

00:00:08.707 --> 00:00:11.118
JAMIE: on how you look at it.

00:00:11.228 --> 00:00:13.656
ALEX: I keep going back and forth
on that.

00:00:13.656 --> 00:00:16.085
ALEX: Because on one hand —
NVIDIA's order book

00:00:16.085 --> 00:00:18.513
ALEX: is enormous. The product
roadmap exists. Colette Kress

00:00:18.513 --> 00:00:20.942
ALEX: has been CFO since 2013. She
knows this

00:00:20.942 --> 00:00:23.370
ALEX: company.
